admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.ko:
볼륨 "{name}" 삭제 복구를 실행하시겠습니까?

진단: {summary}

스냅샷/백업 종속성은 자동 삭제하지 않습니다. 남아 있으면 복구가 차단됩니다.

{mode, select, inspected {Ceph RBD metadata를 검사했으며 삭제 후 backend 부재까지 확인합니다.} other {Ceph RBD 검증이 설정되지 않았거나 불가능하면 성공으로 처리하지 않습니다.}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.en:
Run deletion recovery for volume "{name}"?

Diagnosis: {summary}

Snapshot/backup dependencies are not deleted automatically. Recovery is blocked if any remain.

{mode, select, inspected {Ceph RBD metadata has been inspected, and backend absence will also be verified after deletion.} other {If Ceph RBD verification is not configured or is unavailable, the operation will not be marked as successful.}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.ja:
ボリューム「{name}」の削除復旧を実行しますか？

診断：{summary}

依存するスナップショット／バックアップは自動削除しません。残っている場合は復旧をブロックします。

{mode, select, inspected {Ceph RBDメタデータを検査済みです。削除後にはバックエンドの不在まで確認します。} other {Ceph RBDの検証が未設定または実行できない場合は、成功とは判定しません。}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.zh-CN:
要对卷“{name}”运行删除恢复吗？

诊断：{summary}

不会自动删除依赖的快照/备份。如有残留，将阻止恢复。

{mode, select, inspected {已检查 Ceph RBD 元数据，并将在删除后验证后端已不存在。} other {如果未配置 Ceph RBD 验证或无法进行验证，则不会判定为成功。}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.sw:
Ungependa kutekeleza urejeshaji wa ufutaji wa volumu "{name}"?

Uchunguzi: {summary}

Vitegemezi vya nakala za muda/nakala rudufu havifutwi kiotomatiki. Urejeshaji huzuiwa ikiwa vipo vilivyobaki.

{mode, select, inspected {Metadata za Ceph RBD zimekaguliwa, na kutokuwepo kwa mfumo wa nyuma pia kutathibitishwa baada ya ufutaji.} other {Ikiwa uthibitishaji wa Ceph RBD haujasanidiwa au haupatikani, operesheni haitawekwa alama ya kufaulu.}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.nb:
Kjøre gjenoppretting av sletting for volumet "{name}"?

Diagnose: {summary}

Avhengigheter til øyeblikksbilder og sikkerhetskopier slettes ikke automatisk. Gjenoppretting blokkeres hvis noen gjenstår.

{mode, select, inspected {Ceph RBD-metadata er inspisert, og det vil også bli verifisert at bakenden er fraværende etter sletting.} other {Hvis Ceph RBD-verifisering ikke er konfigurert eller er utilgjengelig, vil operasjonen ikke bli markert som vellykket.}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.ms:
Jalankan pemulihan pemadaman untuk volum "{name}"?

Diagnosis: {summary}

Kebergantungan petikan/sandaran tidak dipadamkan secara automatik. Pemulihan disekat jika masih ada kebergantungan tersebut.

{mode, select, inspected {Metadata Ceph RBD telah diperiksa, dan ketiadaan bahagian belakang juga akan disahkan selepas pemadaman.} other {Jika pengesahan Ceph RBD tidak dikonfigurasikan atau tidak tersedia, operasi ini tidak akan ditandakan sebagai berjaya.}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.vi:
Chạy khôi phục thao tác xóa cho ổ đĩa "{name}"?

Chẩn đoán: {summary}

Các bản chụp nhanh/bản sao lưu phụ thuộc không bị xóa tự động. Quá trình khôi phục sẽ bị chặn nếu vẫn còn bất kỳ tài nguyên phụ thuộc nào.

{mode, select, inspected {Siêu dữ liệu Ceph RBD đã được kiểm tra và việc hệ thống lưu trữ nền không còn tồn tại cũng sẽ được xác minh sau khi xóa.} other {Nếu việc xác minh Ceph RBD chưa được cấu hình hoặc không khả dụng, thao tác sẽ không được đánh dấu là thành công.}}

admin-storage:diagnostic.recoveryConfirm.bn:
আপনি কি "{name}" ভলিউমের মুছে ফেলার প্রক্রিয়া পুনরুদ্ধার চালাতে চান?

ডায়াগনস্টিক: {summary}

স্ন্যাপশট/ব্যাকআপের নির্ভরতা স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে মুছে ফেলা হয় না। কোনোটি অবশিষ্ট থাকলে মুছে ফেলার প্রক্রিয়া পুনরুদ্ধার অবরুদ্ধ করা হবে।

{mode, select, inspected {Ceph RBD মেটাডেটা পরীক্ষা করা হয়েছে এবং মুছে ফেলার পর backend-এর অনুপস্থিতিও যাচাই করা হবে।} other {Ceph RBD যাচাইকরণ কনফিগার করা না থাকলে বা সম্ভব না হলে, এটিকে সফল হিসেবে গণ্য করা হবে না।}}

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.ko:
파일 스토리지 "{name}"를 강제 삭제하시겠습니까?

진단: {summary}

주의: Manila DB/backend 참조가 제거될 수 있으며, backend export/subvolume 부재 또는 일반 삭제 실패가 확인된 경우에만 실행해야 합니다.

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.en:
Force delete file storage "{name}"?

Diagnosis: {summary}

Warning: Manila DB/backend references may be removed. Only proceed when the backend export/subvolume is confirmed missing or normal deletion has been confirmed to fail.

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.ja:
ファイルストレージ「{name}」を強制削除しますか？

診断：{summary}

注意：Manila DB/backendの参照が削除される可能性があります。backendのエクスポート/サブボリュームが存在しない、または通常の削除が失敗したことを確認した場合にのみ実行してください。

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.zh-CN:
是否强制删除文件存储“{name}”？

诊断：{summary}

注意：Manila DB/backend 引用可能被移除，仅在已确认 backend 导出/子卷不存在或常规删除失败时执行。

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.sw:
Ungependa kufuta kwa lazima hifadhi ya faili "{name}"?

Uchunguzi: {summary}

Onyo: Marejeleo katika hifadhidata au mfumo wa nyuma wa Manila yanaweza kuondolewa. Endelea tu ikiwa imethibitishwa kuwa sehemu inayoshirikiwa au volumu ndogo kwenye mfumo wa nyuma haipo, au ufutaji wa kawaida umethibitishwa kushindwa.

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.nb:
Vil du tvangsslette fillagringen "{name}"?

Diagnose: {summary}

Advarsel: Referanser i Manila-databasen og bakenden kan bli fjernet. Fortsett bare når det er bekreftet at eksporten/undervolumet i bakenden mangler, eller at vanlig sletting mislykkes.

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.ms:
Padam storan fail "{name}" secara paksa?

Diagnosis: {summary}

Amaran: Rujukan DB/bahagian belakang Manila mungkin dialih keluar. Teruskan hanya apabila eksport/subvolum bahagian belakang disahkan tiada atau pemadaman biasa disahkan gagal.

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.vi:
Buộc xóa lưu trữ tệp "{name}"?

Chẩn đoán: {summary}

Cảnh báo: Các tham chiếu trong cơ sở dữ liệu/hệ thống lưu trữ nền Manila có thể bị xóa. Chỉ tiếp tục khi đã xác nhận bản xuất/ổ đĩa con trên hệ thống lưu trữ nền không còn tồn tại hoặc đã xác nhận thao tác xóa thông thường thất bại.

admin-storage:fileDetail.forceDeleteConf.bn:
"{name}" ফাইল স্টোরেজ জোরপূর্বক মুছতে চান?

নির্ণয়: {summary}

সতর্কতা: Manila ডেটাবেস/ব্যাকএন্ডের রেফারেন্স মুছে যেতে পারে। শুধু ব্যাকএন্ড এক্সপোর্ট/সাবভলিউম অনুপস্থিত বলে নিশ্চিত হলে অথবা স্বাভাবিকভাবে মোছা ব্যর্থ হয়েছে বলে নিশ্চিত হলেই এগিয়ে যান।

